      RAVEN3: TRAIN + GENERATE          9
      BIGRAM MARKOV TEXT GENERATOR.     1
      TEXT: FIRST 2 LINES OF THE RAVEN, 1
      21 TOKENS, 19 DISTINCT WORDS (SEE 1
      RAVEN3.VOCAB).                    1
      EVERY WORD IS A REGIONAL SYMBOL   1
      T1..T19. A WORD'S OWN SYMBOL NAMES1
      ITS SUCCESSOR LIST: THE LIST OF   1
      WORDS THAT FOLLOWED IT IN THE     1
      TEXT. A WORD THAT FOLLOWED IT     1
      TWICE APPEARS TWICE, SO THE COUNT 1
      IS THE NUMBER OF REPEATS.         1
      PHASE 1 (TRAIN): WALK THE TEXT    1
      LIST T39 AND APPEND EACH WORD TO  1
      THE LIST OF THE WORD BEFORE IT.   1
      PHASE 2 (GENERATE): PRINT THE     1
      TABLE, THEN REPEAT N TIMES: PICK A1
      RANDOM WORD FROM THE CURRENT      1
      WORD'S LIST, PRINT IT, MAKE IT    1
      CURRENT.                          1
      WORKING CELLS: W0 CURRENT WORD, W11
      PREVIOUS WORD, W2 CURRENT TEXT    1
      CELL, W3 THIS WORD, W4 FIRST WORD,1
      W5 STEP COUNTER.                  1
      DEFINE REGIONS                    2 A0            2
      LIST REGION                       2 L0            200
      TOKEN REGION                      2 T0            40
      GENERATOR STEP REGION             2 G0            2
      NUMBER REGION                     2 N0            4
      REGION L0 SUPPLIES LIST CELLS FOR 1
      THE PUSHDOWN STACK AND FOR THE NEW1
      SUCCESSOR ENTRIES.                1
      ROUTINE HEADER. TYPE=5,Q=0.       5       00
      --- MAIN PROGRAM A0 ---           1
      PHASE 1: TRAIN. START AT THE HEAD 1
      CELL OF THE TEXT LIST AND STEP TO 1
      ITS FIRST CELL WITH J60 (LOCATE   1
      NEXT CELL).                       1
      PUSH TEXT LIST HEAD T39             A0    10T39
      J60: (0) = FIRST TEXT CELL                  J60
      W2 = FIRST CELL; POP                      20W2
      READ THE WORD IN THAT CELL WITH   1
      J80 (SYMBOL IN CELL) AND REMEMBER 1
      IT AS THE PREVIOUS WORD W1. ALSO  1
      KEEP A COPY IN W4 SO THE LAST WORD1
      CAN WRAP AROUND TO THE FIRST AT   1
      THE END.                          1
      PUSH CONTENTS OF W2 (THE CELL)            11W2
      J80: (0) = WORD IN CELL                     J80
      W1 = PREVIOUS WORD; POP                   20W1
                                                11W1
      W4 = FIRST WORD                           20W4
      TRAINING LOOP, LABEL 9-1. STEP TO 1
      THE NEXT TEXT CELL. J60 SETS H5+  1
      IF THERE WAS ONE, H5- AT THE END  1
      OF THE LIST; 70 9-9 BRANCHES TO   1
      9-9 WHEN H5-.                     1
      LOOP: PUSH CURRENT CELL             9-1   11W2
      J60: (0) = NEXT CELL, SET H5                J60
      IF H5-, TEXT ENDED: GO 9-9                709-9
      W2 = NEXT CELL; POP                       20W2
                                                11W2
      (0) = WORD IN THAT CELL                     J80
      W3 = THIS WORD; POP                       20W3
      APPEND THIS WORD TO THE SUCCESSOR 1
      LIST OF THE PREVIOUS WORD. J65 =  1
      INSERT (0) AT END OF LIST (1), SO 1
      PUSH THE LIST NAME (W1) FIRST,    1
      THEN THE WORD (W3). THEN THIS WORD1
      BECOMES THE PREVIOUS WORD.        1
      PUSH PREV WORD = LIST NAME (1)            11W1
      PUSH THIS WORD = (0)                      11W3
      J65: APPEND W3 TO LIST W1                   J65
                                                11W3
      W1 = W3; GO BACK TO 9-1                   20W1    9-1
      9-9: TRAINING DONE. J60 LEFT THE  1
      LAST CELL ON THE STACK WHEN IT    1
      FAILED; J8 POPS IT. THEN CLOSE THE1
      CYCLE BY APPENDING THE FIRST WORD 1
      (W4) TO THE LIST OF THE LAST WORD 1
      (W1) SO NO WORD IS A DEAD END.    1
      POP LEFTOVER CELL                   9-9     J8
                                                11W1
                                                11W4
      APPEND FIRST WORD TO LAST WORD'S L          J65
      PRINT THE TRAINED TABLE: J151     1
      PRINTS EACH SUCCESSOR LIST (HEAD  1
      LINE, THEN ONE SUCCESSOR PER      1
      LINE).                            1
                                                10T1
                                                  J151
                                                10T2
                                                  J151
                                                10T3
                                                  J151
                                                10T4
                                                  J151
                                                10T5
                                                  J151
                                                10T6
                                                  J151
                                                10T7
                                                  J151
                                                10T8
                                                  J151
                                                10T9
                                                  J151
                                                10T10
                                                  J151
                                                10T11
                                                  J151
                                                10T12
                                                  J151
                                                10T13
                                                  J151
                                                10T14
                                                  J151
                                                10T15
                                                  J151
                                                10T16
                                                  J151
                                                10T17
                                                  J151
                                                10T18
                                                  J151
                                                10T19
                                                  J151
      PHASE 2: GENERATE. W0 = FIRST     1
      WORD; PRINT IT WITH J152 (PRINT   1
      SYMBOL).                          1
      PUSH FIRST WORD                           10T1
      W0 = CURRENT WORD; POP                    20W0
                                                11W0
      PRINT IT                                    J152
      STEP COUNTER W5 IS A FRESH COPY   1
      (J120) OF THE CONSTANT ZERO N2, SO1
      J125 (ADD 1) DOES NOT CHANGE THE  1
      CONSTANT.                         1
                                                10N2
      J120: COPY OF ZERO                          J120
      W5 = COUNTER = 0                          20W5
      GENERATION LOOP, LABEL 9-2. J116  1
      TESTS (0) < (1): PUSH THE LIMIT N11
      FIRST, THEN THE COUNTER. 70 9-3   1
      LEAVES THE LOOP WHEN THE TEST     1
      FAILS (H5-).                      1
      LOOP: PUSH LIMIT N1 (=(1))          9-2   10N1
      PUSH COUNTER (=(0))                       11W5
      J116: H5+ IF COUNTER < LIMIT                J116
      IF H5-, DONE: GO 9-3                      709-3
      G1: MAKE AND PRINT ONE WORD                 G1
                                                11W5
      J125: ADD 1 TO COUNTER, LEAVE (0)           J125
      J8 POPS (0); GO BACK TO 9-2                 J8    9-2
      9-3: HALT                           9-3     J7    0
      ROUTINE HEADER. TYPE=5,Q=0.       5       00
      --- G1: ONE GENERATION STEP ---   1
      INPUT: W0 = CURRENT WORD. OUTPUT: 1
      W0 = NEXT WORD, ALSO PRINTED.     1
      THE CURRENT WORD'S OWN SYMBOL     1
      NAMES ITS SUCCESSOR LIST. PUSH IT 1
      TWICE: THE TOP COPY IS CONSUMED BY1
      THE COUNT, THE LOWER COPY IS THE  1
      LIST NAME (1) THAT J200 LATER     1
      SEARCHES.                         1
      PUSH CURRENT WORD = LIST NAME       G1    11W0
      PUSH IT AGAIN                             11W0
      J126: (0) = N, LENGTH OF LIST               J126
      J129: (0) = RANDOM R, 0 <= R < N            J129
      J125: R+1 (J200 COUNTS FROM 1)              J125
      J200: (0) = THE (R+1)TH CELL                J200
      J80: (0) = WORD IN THAT CELL                J80
      W0 = NEXT WORD; POP                       20W0
                                                11W0
      PRINT IT; END OF G1                         J152  0
      DATA HEADER. TYPE=5,Q=1.          5       01
      DATA. CONSTANTS: N1 = NUMBER OF   1
      WORDS TO GENERATE, N2 = ZERO.     1
      N1 = STEPS                          N1    01         40
      N2 = ZERO                           N2    01          0
      SUCCESSOR LISTS, ONE PER WORD,    1
      EMPTY UNTIL TRAINED: A HEAD CELL  1
      NAMED BY THE WORD, LINK 0 = NO    1
      CELLS.                            1
      SUCCESSORS OF ONCE                  T1      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF UPON                  T2      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF A                     T3      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF MIDNIGHT              T4      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF DREARY                T5      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF WHILE                 T6      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF I                     T7      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF PONDERED              T8      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF WEAK                  T9      0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF AND                   T10     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF WEARY                 T11     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF OVER                  T12     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF MANY                  T13     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF QUAINT                T14     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF CURIOUS               T15     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF VOLUME                T16     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF OF                    T17     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF FORGOTTEN             T18     0     0
      SUCCESSORS OF LORE                  T19     0     0
      THE TEXT, AS A LIST OF WORD       1
      SYMBOLS, HEAD T39: ONCE UPON A    1
      MIDNIGHT DREARY WHILE I PONDERED  1
      WEAK AND WEARY OVER MANY A QUAINT 1
      AND CURIOUS VOLUME OF FORGOTTEN   1
      LORE                              1
      TEXT LIST                           T39     0
